<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch green coffee imports up in first half 1996.</title>
<headline>Dutch green coffee imports up in first half 1996.</headline>
<dateline>HEERLEN, Netherlands 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Figures for Dutch green coffee imports, in tonnes, with main origins, in Jan-June 1996, issued by the Central Bureau of Statistics.</p>
<p>Note - 14,400 tonnes shipped through Belgium so no origin given on this amount.</p>
<p>    IMPORTS	JAN-JUNE 1996	 JAN-JUNE 1995</p>
<p> Total		   73,134		   65,366</p>
<p> Colombia		15,213		   12,476</p>
<p> Brazil		   3,682		   10,897</p>
<p> Uganda		   6,764		    6,742</p>
<p> Kenya		    3,331		    2,618</p>
<p> El Salvador	    5,005		    2,425</p>
<p> Burundi		  1,869		    2,408</p>
<p> Costa Rica	     3,521		    1,738</p>
<p> Guatemala		2,775		    1,705</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31-20-570-8500</p>
